<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Federal Express cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Federal Express cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Federal Express Corp to long-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- keep Federal Express as intermediate-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Federal Express gained 7/8 to 58-5/8.</p>
</text>
